# Demo mode: leave REPOGUARD_API_BASE_URL unset; only local mock/public GitHub metadata.
# Local live-backend mode (requires FastAPI running on the same computer):
# REPOGUARD_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# REPOGUARD_DASHBOARD_TOKEN=the-same-secret-as-backend-DASHBOARD_TOKEN
# These variables are server-only (never NEXT_PUBLIC_).
# Live proxy is disabled in production builds pending end-user login/OAuth.
